# 🚀 Day 26 – Prior Authorization Workflow Simulator

## 📌 Challenge Overview

Day 26 focused on building an interactive **Prior Authorization Workflow Simulator** using Claude AI. The application simulates the real-world healthcare insurance prior authorization process through a gamified drag-and-drop experience.

The objective was to understand how patient requests move through healthcare providers and insurance payers before treatment approval.

---

# 🏥 Project Description

**Prior Authorization Workflow Simulator**

An interactive web application that demonstrates the complete Prior Authorization (PA) workflow used in the US healthcare system.

The simulator helps users understand every stage of the authorization process while providing educational explanations and workflow tracking.

