# 📋 Workflow Stages

### 1️⃣ Patient Registration

Collect patient information and select a clinical scenario.

↓

### 2️⃣ Medical Necessity Review

Evaluate whether the requested treatment meets clinical guidelines.

↓

### 3️⃣ Document Collection

Prepare required documents:
- Physician Notes
- Diagnosis
- Lab Reports
- Imaging Reports
- Insurance Information

↓

### 4️⃣ Prior Authorization Submission

Submit the completed authorization request to the insurance payer.

↓

### 5️⃣ Payer Review

Insurance company evaluates:
- Medical necessity
- Coverage eligibility
- Supporting documentation

↓

### 6️⃣ Decision

Possible outcomes:

- ✅ Approved
- ⏳ Pending
- ❌ Denied

↓

### 7️⃣ Appeal (If Required)

Provider submits additional documentation or requests Peer-to-Peer Review.

